{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:nexarmauewfouxx6q5i3zfow/app.bsky.feed.post/3m2jw5gash22d","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:nexarmauewfouxx6q5i3zfow","uri":"at://did:plc:nexarmauewfouxx6q5i3zfow/app.bsky.feed.post/3m2jw5gash22d","cid":"bafyreif53am2725q5wpw4wd5zpoxjfwasm4hwugbqfipxyfdw5cd4dpvuu","auteur_did":"did:plc:nexarmauewfouxx6q5i3zfow","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/yanchantrel.bsky.social/post/3m2jw5gash22d","date":"2025-10-06T15:22:58.757Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-10-06T15:22:59.555Z","text":"Le président doit prendre en compte le vote sanction de sa politique en 2024.\n\nNommer un Premier Ministre de gauche\n\nSe mettre en retrait en respectant, sans entraves, l’article 21 de la constitution, avec un PM de cohabitation qui dirigera pleinement l'action du Gouvernement.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:nexarmauewfouxx6q5i3zfow/app.bsky.feed.post/3m2hnlb4uhc2d","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:nexarmauewfouxx6q5i3zfow","uri":"at://did:plc:nexarmauewfouxx6q5i3zfow/app.bsky.feed.post/3m2hnlb4uhc2d","cid":"bafyreic7cbgkefxgsp5jxrdwwzdu7cpjzfuhanuq5lt4lwcyl5ny4jsaum","auteur_did":"did:plc:nexarmauewfouxx6q5i3zfow","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/yanchantrel.bsky.social/post/3m2hnlb4uhc2d","date":"2025-10-05T17:44:19.994Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-10-05T17:44:20.565Z","text":"La rupture selon Lecornu, c’est on prend les mêmes et on recommence.\n\nTrois semaines de palabres pour que rien ne change. \n\nLes mêmes actions produiront les mêmes effets. \n\n#gouvernementlecornu","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"gouvernementlecornu"}],"index":{"byteEnd":198,"byteStart":178}}],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":null,"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
